OL,5,G2325 Sisu
OL,6,     F(2022) Jalmari Helander's
OL,7,     Fultra-violent, Nazi-slaying
OL,8,     Fsurvival adventure starring Jorma
OL,9,     FTommila. A bunch of Nazis try to
OL,10,     Fsteal a grizzled Finnish
OL,11,     Fex-soldier's gold. But he ain't
OL,12,     Fhaving it.
OL,13,G0105 F1 United States GP Qualifying...
OL,14,     F...Highlights: Antonelli has a
OL,15,     Fmathematical chance of wrapping up
OL,16,     Fthe World Championship here in
OL,17,     FTexas... if he can win the GP
OL,18,     Flater today. So he'll be
OL,19,     Fdetermined to do well in
OL,20,     FQualifying.
